WEBVTT

00:17.330 --> 00:18.830
GHOST BUSTERZ!

00:17.710 --> 00:20.460
OH! The time has come

00:18.250 --> 00:18.830
BUSTERZ!

00:20.460 --> 00:23.840
To stand up for tomorrow

00:22.790 --> 00:24.250
OH OH OH!

00:23.840 --> 00:26.420
We're ghostbusterz

00:25.710 --> 00:27.220
OH OH OH!

00:26.420 --> 00:31.050
Breakin' away from the old ghosts

00:31.050 --> 00:34.430
Of history

00:34.430 --> 00:37.810
Breaking free!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

01:03.880 --> 01:05.380
GHOST BUSTERZ!

01:04.250 --> 01:07.010
OH! The time has come

01:04.790 --> 01:05.380
BUSTERZ!

01:07.010 --> 01:10.470
To stand up for tomorrow

01:09.340 --> 01:10.800
OH OH OH!

01:10.470 --> 01:13.300
We're ghostbusterz

01:12.260 --> 01:13.760
OH OH OH!

01:13.300 --> 01:17.100
No fear for anything in our way!

01:15.560 --> 01:17.060
GHOST BUSTERZ!

01:15.640 --> 01:20.440
Presented by Strelizia subs

01:16.470 --> 01:17.060
BUSTERZ!

01:17.100 --> 01:18.640
The time has come

01:18.390 --> 01:19.890
GHOST BUSTERZ!

01:32.820 --> 01:37.040
The seventh month of 1600 AD, or Keicho 5.

01:37.410 --> 01:41.210
Charging Tokugawa Ieyasu with thirteen articles of impeachment,

01:41.210 --> 01:48.130
Ishida Mitsunari sent messengers to various daimyo in the name of the Toyotomi clan,

01:48.130 --> 01:51.300
telling them to raise armies.

01:51.300 --> 01:56.390
At the same time, beings seeking to end the period of turbulence

01:56.390 --> 02:00.270
and build a kingdom to last a thousand years

02:00.270 --> 02:04.520
were about to awaken from a thousand-year sleep.

02:04.520 --> 02:06.520
And then...

02:06.520 --> 02:10.280
On the fifteenth day of the ninth month, at Sekigahara,

02:10.280 --> 02:12.740
the Eastern Army of Tokugawa Ieyasu clashed with

02:12.740 --> 02:17.870
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and Ishida Mitsunari.

02:17.870 --> 02:21.330
As a result of the performance of Kobayakawa Hideaki's troops,

02:21.330 --> 02:27.250
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and
Ishida Mitsunari achieved a sweeping victory,

02:27.250 --> 02:33.510
bringing what should have been
three hundred years of peace to the world.

02:34.340 --> 02:39.390
You should all be quite familiar with this story...

02:46.820 --> 02:49.760
Sanada Ten Braves

03:08.880 --> 03:09.960
Kaguya!

03:11.800 --> 03:14.300
Our fight is not over yet!

03:16.970 --> 03:18.300
You're Yukimura Sanada!

03:18.760 --> 03:21.510
Lord Hidetada Tokugawa!

03:22.180 --> 03:26.020
Look at that!
Are we all friends?

03:26.390 --> 03:27.810
There's no way we are!

03:30.690 --> 03:34.490
Oh my, you all look uncomfortable.

03:36.650 --> 03:38.240
Lord Hidetada,

03:38.410 --> 03:41.950
are you raising your sword
against Princess Kaguya?

03:45.330 --> 03:51.500
As you are well aware, Princess Kaguya is the
adoptive daughter of late Lord Hideyoshi.

03:51.670 --> 03:54.420
If you persist in threatening her...

03:54.590 --> 03:56.290
we of the Toyotomi clan...

03:56.840 --> 03:58.970
will be forced to intervene.

04:02.510 --> 04:03.850
That is not...

04:05.890 --> 04:07.180
my intention.

04:08.770 --> 04:10.270
Who is this girl?

04:10.980 --> 04:13.070
That doesn't concern you.

04:13.230 --> 04:15.610
Please forgive me.

04:16.440 --> 04:19.570
Please allow me to retreat.

04:27.210 --> 04:30.830
He vanished quickly!
Yet he seemed so determined.

04:31.000 --> 04:33.130
You're not too bad, beauty.

04:34.050 --> 04:37.550
Him being gone makes things a lot easier.

04:39.050 --> 04:41.760
Well, back to our own business.

04:42.180 --> 04:48.680
Mr. Musashi and Mr. Ronin, I beg of you,
do not hand Yume over to them.

04:49.390 --> 04:53.440
I wasn't planning on doing that, Kaguya.

04:53.610 --> 04:54.770
Isn't that right, Ronin?

04:54.940 --> 04:57.400
Yeah, don't worry about it.

04:58.110 --> 04:59.450
Thank you so much.

05:00.820 --> 05:04.120
Ronin, aren't you tired?
I can hold her instead.

05:04.280 --> 05:05.740
No, I'm fine.

05:06.740 --> 05:08.870
You look happy.

05:09.460 --> 05:10.920
No, I don't!

05:11.370 --> 05:13.870
- Then I'll hold her.
- Again, there is no need!

05:13.880 --> 05:15.310
You get the best job.

05:15.630 --> 05:16.880
Yes.

05:17.210 --> 05:18.380
Got you.

05:21.840 --> 05:23.050
I understand.

05:24.100 --> 05:27.600
So you are the famous castle
robber, Musashi Miyamoto.

05:27.770 --> 05:28.970
That's me!

05:28.980 --> 05:32.770
And you want to get the
damsel back at all costs.

05:33.770 --> 05:34.610
Obviously.

05:35.480 --> 05:40.280
I think you can tell you have
to beat me first to get her.

05:40.440 --> 05:41.670
Me too.

05:42.070 --> 05:44.370
This does not concern you.

05:44.910 --> 05:49.450
Lord Yukimura, what do you
intend to do with Princess Yume?

05:49.620 --> 05:50.750
Would you like to know?

05:51.540 --> 05:56.750
As Lord Mitsunari Ishida has ordered,
I will take her to the safest place there is.

05:57.460 --> 05:59.130
The safest place there is?

06:00.420 --> 06:03.630
Osaka Castle, your home.

06:05.930 --> 06:08.930
Why is the shogunate doing this?

06:09.850 --> 06:17.480
To protect her, of course, from evil
people who want to take her life.

06:18.860 --> 06:20.130
And yet...

06:20.190 --> 06:25.620
this damsel ran on foot down the
mountain to escape from you.

06:25.780 --> 06:27.450
Which means...

06:27.950 --> 06:30.870
you might be the "evil people" you speak of.

06:32.710 --> 06:33.660
I repeat, you.

06:35.500 --> 06:38.000
So, you refuse to return her to me?

06:38.840 --> 06:40.550
I told you already!

06:41.380 --> 06:43.300
You have to beat us first!

06:43.510 --> 06:44.770
Whenever you're ready!

06:56.650 --> 06:59.360
You're not touching Lord Yukimura.

07:00.020 --> 07:01.900
And you are?

07:03.240 --> 07:07.620
We're part of the Sanada Ten Braves,

07:07.780 --> 07:10.240
Japan's most powerful army corps!

07:10.410 --> 07:13.040
I am Miyoshi Seikai Nyudo!

07:15.040 --> 07:17.830
I am Jimpachi Nezu!

07:19.960 --> 07:22.840
I am Saizo Kirigakure!

07:24.840 --> 07:27.390
What a bunch of blowhards.

07:28.140 --> 07:29.970
One, two, three.

07:30.140 --> 07:32.720
You're missing seven.

07:32.890 --> 07:34.180
You're right.

07:34.350 --> 07:37.440
You're now called Sanada Three Brave!

07:38.150 --> 07:41.270
Even only three can beat you without any issues.

07:42.530 --> 07:44.990
Confident, are we?

07:46.570 --> 07:49.410
Bastard, don't dare mock us!

07:52.410 --> 07:53.580
Bastard!

08:04.420 --> 08:06.880
- I trust you to keep her safe.
- I understand.

08:08.010 --> 08:09.120
On your guard!

08:30.490 --> 08:31.670
Dammit!

08:34.660 --> 08:38.210
They call you "Ronin"?
You're pretty good!

08:38.370 --> 08:39.830
But what is your real name?

08:40.670 --> 08:42.000
Ronin!

08:42.210 --> 08:43.590
Are you mocking me?

08:45.380 --> 08:46.670
<i>Fuken Hado</i>!

08:57.770 --> 08:58.810
Musashi!

08:59.350 --> 09:01.640
That's nothing!
Flammable bullets!

09:16.450 --> 09:18.200
That gun can shoot fire?

09:19.500 --> 09:23.210
Saizo Kirigakure!
Be careful, that's dangerous!

09:23.960 --> 09:25.880
Nyudo! I am counting on you!

09:26.960 --> 09:30.670
<i>Onmichinarishi eisowaka.
Onmichinarishi eisowaka.</i>

09:33.220 --> 09:34.600
He disappeared!

09:34.760 --> 09:38.180
He's better than our wimpy Ninjamaru!

09:41.770 --> 09:43.980
I told you it's <i>Ninjataro</i>!

09:45.110 --> 09:46.440
Why did I say that?

09:46.610 --> 09:54.160
Well, I followed the foreigner as
Musashi asked, but I think I got lost.

10:00.000 --> 10:01.370
What brutal strength!

10:16.680 --> 10:17.970
She's gone!

10:34.570 --> 10:35.950
Where am I?

10:36.120 --> 10:37.620
Are you feeling well?

10:37.780 --> 10:39.370
Are you Princess Kaguya?

10:40.330 --> 10:42.040
Is your memory returning?

10:43.500 --> 10:45.370
No, but I know you well...

10:46.130 --> 10:49.500
because you often appear
in my dreams with Musashi.

10:49.710 --> 10:52.720
- In your dreams with Musashi?
- My dreams...

10:52.880 --> 10:54.130
Princess Yume.

10:54.300 --> 10:57.850
Nobody even knows your real name.

10:59.760 --> 11:01.060
Where is Musashi?

11:01.220 --> 11:02.980
Where is Musashi at?

11:04.850 --> 11:07.520
I always have the same dream.

11:08.520 --> 11:17.110
To save us, Musashi and Ronin must face
Yukimura Sanada and his subordinates.

11:17.280 --> 11:18.070
Indeed...

11:18.660 --> 11:23.750
Tell me, Princess Kaguya,
did my dream become reality?

11:24.290 --> 11:30.210
Indeed, Musashi and Ronin are
facing Sanada and his men right now.

11:30.340 --> 11:32.420
I knew it!

11:33.130 --> 11:34.680
It was more than just a dream!

11:35.170 --> 11:38.180
Musashi saved me.

11:38.890 --> 11:40.550
But, Princess Yume...

11:43.810 --> 11:45.010
Who is there?

11:49.310 --> 11:52.730
I saw you!
Get out of there!

12:08.050 --> 12:09.180
Princess Kaguya!

12:09.340 --> 12:11.930
Don't worry, I'll protect you.

12:12.760 --> 12:15.310
If you don't get out of there,
I'll go search for you!

12:16.180 --> 12:18.710
As I'd expect from Princess Kaguya...

12:19.020 --> 12:21.690
you're no ordinary woman.

12:21.860 --> 12:23.080
Who are you?

12:32.620 --> 12:35.290
- Kobayakawa?
- Kobayakawa?

12:36.330 --> 12:40.710
I am glad to see you, Princess Kaguya.
How are you?

12:41.290 --> 12:44.800
Why are you here,
Hideaki Kobayakawa?

12:45.000 --> 12:47.300
Like me, Hideaki Kobayakawa was locked up...

12:47.460 --> 12:52.010
in the dungeons of Ishinari Mitsuda's castle.

12:52.470 --> 12:54.430
Is that true?

12:55.720 --> 13:00.770
It seems that I'm not in the good
graces of some shogunate leaders.

13:31.840 --> 13:33.430
Get me the hell out of here!

13:33.590 --> 13:35.970
I am Hideaki Kobayakawa!

13:36.470 --> 13:40.680
It is because of me that the army
of the west won at Sekigahara!

13:40.850 --> 13:44.230
I contributed to the rise of the Toyotomi!

13:45.060 --> 13:48.690
So why should I be thrown into prison?

13:48.860 --> 13:52.740
Someone tell Lord Mitsunari Ishida about this!

13:52.910 --> 13:54.530
It's a misunderstanding!

13:55.450 --> 13:57.950
It's too much...

13:58.120 --> 14:00.000
It's undignified treatment!

14:02.330 --> 14:04.170
Do not give in to despair.

14:05.540 --> 14:07.290
Help will arrive.

14:11.470 --> 14:14.220
It's all right, just calm down.

14:14.390 --> 14:18.060
In fact, a certain Musashi
Miyamoto will come to our rescue.

14:27.560 --> 14:29.900
Listen to me, Lord Hideaki.

14:30.070 --> 14:35.320
As I was saying, Musashi is
very close and saved me.

14:36.990 --> 14:43.580
He defended me against Sanada's men,
who he may be fighting at this very moment.

14:44.960 --> 14:46.750
Is that true?

14:48.670 --> 14:53.220
Is it also true that he can use the demon gun?

14:54.380 --> 14:55.760
It's true.

14:57.930 --> 15:01.310
My dreams were real after all!

15:01.520 --> 15:03.600
Indeed.

15:08.270 --> 15:10.820
What's the matter, Lord Hideaki?

15:11.020 --> 15:12.170
Nothing!

15:12.480 --> 15:16.910
Princess Yume, Sanada
may show up at any time.

15:17.070 --> 15:18.490
Let's get away from here.

15:19.070 --> 15:20.450
I'll go with you!

15:21.620 --> 15:22.660
But...

15:22.830 --> 15:30.090
Yukimura Sanada is the loyal subordinate of
Mitsunari Ishida, who threw me into prison.

15:30.210 --> 15:35.380
I will protect both of you,
even if my life depends on it!

15:36.300 --> 15:37.720
Thank you very much.

16:15.260 --> 16:17.840
Watch out, I'm going to catch you!

16:19.260 --> 16:20.590
Help me!

16:21.390 --> 16:25.150
Run away! You will become
a grandma If I catch you!

16:43.490 --> 16:46.160
Hideaki Kobayakawa...

16:46.830 --> 16:49.620
What are you scheming?

16:56.880 --> 16:58.840
Got you!

17:20.570 --> 17:22.530
That was fun!

17:24.160 --> 17:26.990
Yasha, is there any news?

17:27.160 --> 17:29.410
What do you mean?

17:29.580 --> 17:33.710
I mean about the kidnapping of Princess Kaguya!

17:34.750 --> 17:37.500
We are having some difficulties.

17:38.710 --> 17:39.960
Can't be helped.

17:39.970 --> 17:43.430
Prepare me five more girls full of life.

17:43.590 --> 17:47.260
This cat-and-mouse game really amuses me.

17:48.180 --> 17:49.640
Very well...

17:51.440 --> 17:53.150
Princess Yume.

17:53.310 --> 17:55.610
Hideaki Kobayakawa.

17:56.400 --> 18:00.440
That is an interesting twist of fate.

18:07.870 --> 18:09.040
Take that!

18:18.130 --> 18:20.840
Did Princess Kaguya manage to save herself?

18:21.550 --> 18:25.930
It will be ok!
That princess is talented.

18:26.430 --> 18:28.470
That said...

18:28.680 --> 18:30.890
Yukimura Sanada disappeared!

18:31.890 --> 18:35.450
Oh no, he must have chased
after Kaguya and the other girl!

18:38.770 --> 18:41.690
You will go no further
without beating us first!

18:43.030 --> 18:44.360
He is tough!

18:50.830 --> 18:56.250
Princess Kaguya, I am sorry, but I will
be taking Princess Yume to Osaka.

18:56.960 --> 18:58.710
And if I refuse?

18:59.540 --> 19:01.710
Why would you refuse?

19:02.340 --> 19:07.470
I will not allow the shogunate to use Yume.

19:07.930 --> 19:09.600
Well, that is embarrassing.

19:09.760 --> 19:12.640
You're part of the shogunate, Princess Kaguya.

19:12.810 --> 19:15.230
Do you really believe that?

19:15.390 --> 19:18.610
I am just a tool for the shogunate.

19:18.770 --> 19:21.530
Don't tell me you didn't know that.

19:23.900 --> 19:25.110
Princess Kaguya...

19:25.780 --> 19:29.700
If you want her, you have to beat me first.

19:31.830 --> 19:34.660
Hideaki, protect Yume.

19:34.830 --> 19:35.750
Very well.

19:38.790 --> 19:43.710
It will be fine, and in case we're
in danger, Musashi will save us.

19:43.880 --> 19:46.090
- Isn't that true, Princess Yume?
- Yes.

19:49.050 --> 19:51.890
Now, on your guard, Yukimura.

19:52.430 --> 19:58.810
Unless you prefer to claim that you do not want to
fight the adopted daughter of the late Hideyoshi.

19:58.980 --> 20:00.810
How mean of you...

20:01.610 --> 20:05.030
But I will be merciless, princess or not.

20:10.530 --> 20:13.830
It's such a shame that you're a princess.

20:14.540 --> 20:18.330
You are also too beautiful
to be a samurai leader.

20:25.800 --> 20:26.950
Coward!

20:28.220 --> 20:30.180
Thank you, Lord Hideaki!

20:31.140 --> 20:32.970
No need to thank me.

20:36.730 --> 20:39.690
What are you doing, Kobayakawa?

20:41.520 --> 20:44.980
Hideaki Kobayakawa...

20:46.570 --> 20:47.940
Kobayakawa?

20:49.150 --> 20:52.070
Don't be afraid.

20:52.240 --> 20:55.200
All of this is necessary to meet Musashi.

21:03.670 --> 21:05.300
Where are you taking me?

21:05.800 --> 21:08.090
Where Musashi will come to save us.

21:13.640 --> 21:16.850
Hideaki Kobayakawa,
what are you scheming?

21:17.310 --> 21:19.310
Tell Musashi Miyamoto...

21:19.480 --> 21:22.020
that if he wants to save
Kaguya and Yume...

21:22.190 --> 21:26.480
he must go to Ishida's castle,
where I was imprisoned!

21:27.360 --> 21:28.470
What?

21:28.610 --> 21:33.110
He will have to conquer the castle if he
wants to save them. Do you understand?

21:34.030 --> 21:35.450
Tell him that.

21:37.080 --> 21:38.410
Yukimura Sanada,

21:38.580 --> 21:42.830
If you want Princess Yume,
you'll have to take the castle!

21:43.750 --> 21:45.000
Is this a game for you?

21:45.460 --> 21:51.130
Between Musashi and Yukimura,
who will be the first to save the princess?

21:53.260 --> 21:55.100
I'm ready for a good spectacle!

22:04.650 --> 22:07.520
You guys are really tough!

22:07.690 --> 22:09.100
You too, bastard!

22:09.400 --> 22:12.450
This is never gonna end!

22:13.490 --> 22:15.820
One of us will have to give up!

22:22.460 --> 22:23.960
Lord Yukimura!

22:24.120 --> 22:26.500
Lord Yukimura, are you ok?

22:29.130 --> 22:30.510
Are you hurt?

22:33.380 --> 22:35.760
Shouldn't we be fighting to the death?

22:36.390 --> 22:38.350
Shut up!
Now is not the time!

22:38.720 --> 22:41.350
They change their minds really fast.

22:41.520 --> 22:45.270
They must really care about <i>their</i> Yukimura.

22:46.190 --> 22:48.100
- Are you jealous?
- Shut up!

22:48.980 --> 22:50.090
Musashi...

22:51.360 --> 22:52.360
Hi!

22:53.070 --> 22:57.000
Hideaki Kobayaka has kidnapped
Princess Yume and Princess Kaguya!

22:57.870 --> 22:59.110
What did you say?

22:59.450 --> 23:01.330
Hideaki Kobayakawa?

23:01.450 --> 23:04.710
The one from the battle of Sekigahara?

23:05.750 --> 23:09.210
We have to compete to conquer the castle.

23:10.210 --> 23:11.760
Compete?

23:16.010 --> 23:22.560
Whichever of us takes the castle
first will be entitled to Princess Yume.

23:23.850 --> 23:25.480
Conquer the castle?

23:26.140 --> 23:27.440
What are you going to do?

23:28.020 --> 23:30.610
Don't ask me such
a stupid question, Ronin!

23:30.770 --> 23:32.690
I'm excited to do it!

23:33.400 --> 23:35.650
Good, I understand.

23:36.570 --> 23:38.950
My warriors, are you ready?

23:40.620 --> 23:43.290
We're at your command!

23:43.410 --> 23:46.710
We will win the competition!

23:50.920 --> 23:52.800
I'll be waiting for you!

23:52.960 --> 23:57.010
This will be very fun!
You will not regret it!

24:00.250 --> 24:03.000
In my natural, unadorned style,

24:03.000 --> 24:05.840
I'll tell you these feelings of mine

24:05.840 --> 24:11.180
Together to the sky past the darkness!

24:11.180 --> 24:16.310
All we need to do is spread our wings and fly!

24:17.850 --> 24:22.980
Baby, we'll send time flowing forward just a little,

24:22.980 --> 24:29.160
and we'll embrace even the harsh gusts of wind

24:29.160 --> 24:34.490
with sympathy for pointless worries

24:34.490 --> 24:38.620
and a melody that will overcome the pain

24:41.000 --> 24:51.390
If the poison of the flower that bloomed in my cupped hands

24:51.390 --> 25:02.310
has managed to pierce through the center of my heart...

25:02.310 --> 25:05.070
In my natural, unadorned style,

25:05.070 --> 25:07.940
I'll tell you these feelings of mine,

25:07.940 --> 25:13.530
Unraveling this puzzle of the heart

25:13.530 --> 25:16.290
I'll bring out every part

25:16.290 --> 25:19.290
of your unchanging style

25:19.290 --> 25:24.590
Together to the sky past the darkness!

25:24.590 --> 25:29.760
All we need to do is spread our wings and fly!

25:31.380 --> 25:33.720
We're finally conquering a castle!

25:33.930 --> 25:36.930
Our spoils will be Princess Kaguya
and Princess Yume!

25:36.930 --> 25:38.430
There's no way we can lose!

25:38.600 --> 25:41.730
The next chapter: <i>Battle For The Castle</i>!
